{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1000_p", "source_sha256": "554e852f7ebe024413a3672f5888d0ab7676175cf278cf621bb99c9225c52fd9", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\n星梨花のテーマは『小悪魔な少女』だ……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄平面杂志的联动企划。\n星梨花的主题是“小恶魔少女”……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "de5e0e58f7dfb7028ffaa74f7ab6028548bb8c77dfec0ad817db78b1899fa7fc", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　準備終わりました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！准备好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1002_p", "source_sha256": "663d38600fe1a760055eeee64693e90d43c70686b34b76b5e7ddfe901b8df7df", "ja": "おお、早かったな！\n衣装合わせのときも思ったけど、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "哦，真快啊！\n我在试穿服装的时候就觉得了，真的很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "92f0a6354ab283c41b06758e425dce14ee7c8cf416b840ac1f50eb315d03b84f", "ja": "本当ですか？　実はわたし、\nちゃんと悪魔になれてるか少し不安で……。", "zh": "真的吗？其实我有点担心……不知道自己有没有好好变成恶魔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "d67372143a45f8a0766670e8f69340fd30adb538a71780bb55a788ab12fc413b", "ja": "今日の撮影の話をパパにしたら、\n「星梨花は悪魔じゃなくて天使だろう！」って……。", "zh": "今天把今天拍摄的事告诉爸爸后，他说：“星梨花不是恶魔，而是天使吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1f15b3e399834292933b4df07ff4f8a0470b366bd6df43943a85169731b20975", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\nまぁ、なんとなく言いたいことはわかるかな。", "zh": "原、原来如此……\n嗯，我大概能明白你想说什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e32f39256fc70a2e42ebc08ea37787c78f9b7b0831bdafa5288865283278860", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さんの中では、\nわたしは天使より悪魔のイメージなんでしょうか？", "zh": "那个……在{$P$}先生眼里，\n比起天使，我更接近恶魔的形象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "1f4aaf27ec91fd9a1a6cf76d225819bfa7d0190e12f26ee203cc8409b7c88aa6", "ja": "それとも、やっぱりパパと同じで、\n天使っぽいイメージですか？", "zh": "还是说，和爸爸一样，觉得我是偏天使的形象呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1008_p", "source_sha256": "82fb9e1c9288d9b96782d526e5d4dacd97cea6698dd63c914b62763455c4508a", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……\n俺も天使のほうが、星梨花に合ってると思う。", "zh": "嗯——怎么说呢……\n我也觉得天使更适合星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2fce3a4539e8aafc211dfdf43bf0e0678ee060fc1d534a2bb30526205f3b88e5", "ja": "けど……そんな天使のような子が実は悪魔だった、\nなんて想像すると、すごく怖いと思うんだ。", "zh": "可是……一想到那样天使般的孩子其实是恶魔，就觉得特别可怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "66c1102e344f3d07cbcc751ad859d957a454ba672eee3ecf57feae40d33edff7", "ja": "天使の子が悪魔に……。\nううっ……それは、ちょっと怖いかもしれません。", "zh": "天使般的孩子变成恶魔……  \n呜呜……那可能确实有点可怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d5551a28af18211f5377f3f9391acb32a52bf357cb5bb7d8b0f7e7e333fc783b", "ja": "ああ。だから今回は、悪魔の衣装を着てもらったんだ。\n星梨花の新しい魅力が見られると思ってね。", "zh": "啊。所以这次才让你穿上恶魔的服装。\n我觉得应该能看到星梨花全新的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "3f5c66a6c3d25a36204b5c030e8ad852c9c9e64d4dead76d086618e960b5b5ae", "ja": "そういうことだったんですね！　わたし、\n悪魔らしく怖くしなきゃって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊！我还想着，既然是恶魔，就得表现得吓人一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "dc22b1c5bc03bbb4e5d9b527e7cc292e2de75a03c4b5de1b02a4224bac81d47e", "ja": "怖くしなくていい悪魔なら……あれ？　怖くないけど、\nでもそれが怖くて……悪魔は怖くないのが怖い？", "zh": "如果是不需要装得可怕的恶魔……咦？虽然不可怕，可正因为不可怕才让人害怕……恶魔是因为不可怕才可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1014_p", "source_sha256": "47f01b21c0989bfef8fe3726f9b396a9bd79da307476a6f1cbb4f63d8d5ae2a2", "ja": "あ、あんまり気負わなくて大丈夫だよ！\nいつも通りの星梨花でいいんだ。", "zh": "啊，不用太紧张，没关系的！\n保持平时的星梨花就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "314509414ad4d88c3aebef538eea5cc7b7e0b6a9647e61d6813f25f5445b0557", "ja": "わかりました。いつも通りのわたしで……\n頑張って悪魔になりますね！", "zh": "我明白了。我会和平常的我一样……\n努力去演好恶魔的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "a905f1d6bb692eff01dcf003fca5e094f3ba15930d2c34de1ef1d050e0bb8de6", "ja": "悪魔もちゃんとできたって知ったら、\nパパ、ビックリしちゃうかもしれませんね。えへへ♪", "zh": "要是爸爸知道我也能好好扮演恶魔，说不定会吓一跳呢。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0703_1017_p", "source_sha256": "40c3659d3ce469c840dae827f662a457f73d9242f8a4693f6df93585c5cf365d", "ja": "う、うん、そうだな……。\n写真を見たらきっと、驚くかもな。あは、あはは……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，是啊……。\n看了照片之后，他肯定会吓一跳吧。啊哈，啊哈哈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
